      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API and worker share one trusted identity; containers are not privilege isolation.\nModel output cannot authorize publication. Instructions do not guarantee grounded answers.\nAll app/data access is private. Network access is shown separately in the connectivity diagram.",
      "originalText": "API and worker share one trusted identity; containers are not privilege isolation.\nModel output cannot authorize publication. Instructions do not guarantee grounded answers.\nAll app/data access is private. Network access is shown separately in the connectivity diagram.",
